{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"bg","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"layer":"bg","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呜哇！这里还有药田呀！还种着这么多上好的药草！家里能有这么几块药圃，可是多少制药师做梦都得不到的好事啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好家伙，刚进门就给我这么大个惊喜，想必你的制药台准能让我惊掉下巴！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_5","text":"（把阿娜洛洁带到制药台前。）"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]哇哦！大药锅！天平秤！还有这么多玻璃瓶！就算是大书院最齐备的制药台，顶多也就这样了吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"bubble\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara043_1\": \"01\"\r    }\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这趟真没白来！{myName}，我把药材都备齐了，能在我这个新人制药师面前露一手你的绝活吗？求你了求你了！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_8","text":"所以说别夸我了啦……"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_9","text":"（在制药台前制作一瓶生命药水。）"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]嗯嗯……手法老道，技艺精湛，这水准完全不输黑森林顶尖的制药师，你比我想的还要厉害多了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过你这是用的精炼制药法吧？也只有你这样的高手能在这么简陋的环境里炼出这么高质量的药水。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但这法子太吃制药师本事了。真的要把产量拉起来，会消耗你特别多精力，到最后可能效率也不高。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_13","text":"是这么回事。"},{"tag":"tag_13","text":"我也觉得有些磨人。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]所以呢……我之前琢磨出了个新法子，主打的就是一个量大管饱，而且就算是菜鸟也能轻松上手！{myName}有兴趣为我指点一二不？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_15","text":"还有这么好的事？"},{"tag":"tag_15","text":"洗耳恭听！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]好嘞！咱先把你这些精密器材放在一边，只用准备个大锅——就用我的这口吧——这种傻瓜式制药法就得用这种大家伙。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]就像我这样……先把药草备好，等水温稍微暖乎点，再把药草一股脑倒进去。然后照着这张时间表，掐着点儿往里加料。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]最后抄根棍子开搅，就像我这样拿着棍子搅呀搅呀……瞧！一大锅药水就这么成了。你看，质量还挺凑合，对吧！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_19","text":"步骤确实通俗易懂。"},{"tag":"tag_19","text":"品质也算差强人意。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]嘿，普通人一学就会的法子，要求就别太高啦！关键是这法子能在合适的时间里，哐哐造出一大堆质量合格的生命药水。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你想想，咱要是整一堆大锅和药材，再雇些人手按这法子开工，那不得赚大发了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你这儿还有药田，连进原材料的钱都能省下一大笔。咱俩联手投点本钱进去，将来肯定赚得盆满钵满，这买卖绝对能成！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_23","text":"买卖啊……"},{"tag":"tag_23","text":"生意啊……"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]啊呀。瞧我这脑子，一不留神就拐到别处去了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉，都是常年跑买卖落下的毛病，总是不自觉地把啥事儿都往生意上扯，多包涵哈。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]对了……咱刚才聊到哪儿了……哦对！除了制药法，我还有个新配方呢。用赤剑草的浆液配上一小把金铃草粗末，再混进一些岩蟾蜍的趾甲，提神健脑，元气通透！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这配方我自己试过了。虽然还是个粗方，但效果也还成。最妙的是材料特别好找，野外随手就能弄到，质量差点儿但当个辅助用强化药也足够了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说这配方定个啥价好？要不我先标个原价三百阿比，优惠价二百五，这样应该挺能勾人的吧？对了，还可以配魔力丸一起打包卖给那些秘术师！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"bubble\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara043_1\": \"05\"\r    }\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊，对了对了，我还有个绝妙的主意！就把这新配方和傻瓜制药法打包一起卖给那些新人制药师，销量肯定蹭蹭涨！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]到时候咱们的生意火到不行！赚的钱够咱俩逍遥几辈子啦！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_34","text":"……是、是吗……"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"fore","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"layer":"fore","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":350,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"y":-119,"img":"chara043_1","addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"bg","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]（看来阿娜洛洁起了兴致，还是不要打扰她，让她说下去吧。）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]（……于是和制药师阿娜洛洁硬是讨论了一整天的生意经。）[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"layer":"fore","trans":true,"noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","sc